      },
      "context": "/ (requireStaffSession + overview:read) — Operations centre for staff: what needs action first (reports, release review, failed tracks), then KPIs, listens, the track pipeline, reports by type, accounts and the audit trail, each in its own bento tile. The sidebar footer switches the language (English ↔ Українська), cycles the theme (Dark → Light → Dim) and collapses the panel to a rail. Not-found is not drawn: unknown admin routes redirect to /. Login and /no-access are separate routes without the shell. · no mobile frame: phones have no side panel; the menu button opens it as a sheet (see Menu open)"
    },
